# Services Folder
# 
# Purpose: Contain business logic and orchestrate data operations
# 
# Best Practices:
# - Services contain the core business logic of your application
# - Services interact with models/repositories to perform data operations
# - One service per domain/resource (e.g., poll.service.ts, ai.service.ts)
# - Services can call other services when needed
# - Keep services independent and testable
# - Handle business rules and validation logic here
# - Services should not directly handle HTTP requests/responses
# - Use dependency injection when possible for better testability
# 
# Example structure:
# - poll.service.ts
# - response.service.ts
# - ai.service.ts (AI processing logic)
# - clustering.service.ts

